{"a":[45,47],"h":"<p>45.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"75\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 74.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 25.4 25.4 34.4 34.4 42.7 51.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"42.7 51.7 58.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Onun için şimdi bırak onları o keyd yapmak istiyenleri<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 160.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 33.8 40.6 40.6 48.8 64.6 71.3 79.6 79.6 86.3 98.3 98.3 114.0 125.3 125.3 125.3 132.0\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.8 48.8 91.6 132.0 144.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> tâ o günlerine çatacakları deme kadar<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"161\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 161.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.0 48.8 48.8 63.0 63.0 78.8 78.8 85.6 92.3 92.3 108.0 121.6 121.6 130.6 130.6 138.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 42.0 130.6 144.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ki o gün çarpılacaklar - helâk olacaklar 46. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"252\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 252.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.2 23.2 30.0 30.0 36.7 57.0 57.0 66.0 66.0 75.0 75.0 84.0 84.0 90.7 111.0 111.0 120.0 120.0 128.2 128.2 135.0 153.0 164.2 164.2 171.0 171.0 177.7 177.7 193.4 214.4 221.2 221.2 229.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"36.7 90.7 135.0 198.0 214.4 229.4 236.2\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o gün ki hiç o keyd-ü tedbirlerinin kendilerine zerrece faidesi olmıyacak<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"143\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 143.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.0 35.2 35.2 42.7 57.0 57.0 63.7 63.7 79.4 79.4 88.4 88.4 106.4 118.4\" y=\"26.3 26.3 21.1 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 42.7 111.0 118.4 126.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve hiç bir taraftan kurtarılmıyacaklar - işte Peygambere suikasd tertib etmek istiyen Ebû cehil ve akranı Bedir günü böyle olmuşlardı 47.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"158\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 158.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.3 31.4 31.4 40.4 47.3 66.7 77.3 84.0 84.0 93.0 93.0 99.7 99.7 116.3 116.3 126.7 126.7 133.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"40.4 47.3 66.7 93.0 116.3 133.4 141.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve o zulmedenlere <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"147\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 146.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 33.0 33.0 40.6 40.6 57.0 67.6 75.7 75.7 92.3 99.0 99.0 105.7 112.6 121.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 57.0 112.6 121.6 130.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> onun önünde de bir azâb vardır. - Burada iki ihtimal vardır. Birisi, o günden beride, ya'ni Dünyada bir azâb daha var demektir. Netekim Mekkeliler yedi sene kıtlık çekmişlerdi. Bundan başka o günden ötede, ya'ni ölümlerinden sonra kabirde ve Âhırette bir azâb daha var demek de olabilir.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"199\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 199.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 44.3 51.0 51.0 57.7 64.6 85.6 85.6 94.6 94.6 103.6 111.0 117.7 117.7 129.0 144.7 144.7 155.3 155.3 167.3 167.3 174.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 44.3 57.7 69.0 103.6 111.0 129.0 144.7 174.7 183.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Velâkin onların pek çokları bilmezler - akıbetin böyle olacağını da onun için küfrederler. </p>"}